      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree. But I can also see how having them show up in Files would be nice for some users.\n\n1. Put them in Photos by Default.\n\n2. Be sure to put them in a VRChat folder too.\n\n3. Put in a Toggle to switch to placing them in Files. It's already working, no engineering effort needed to get it working. Just put in a Toggle for users who will find it useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
